# Chakra tokens (Vandrounik)

Theme: `src/theme/system.ts`. Spec: `docs/ui/design-tokens.md`.

## Do

- Colors: `background`, `foreground`, `primary`, `primaryFg`, `secondary`, `secondaryFg`, `muted`, `line`, `destructive`, `screen`, `canvas`
- Radii: `checkbox`, `sm`, `btn`, `seg`, `card`, `sheet`, `tab`, `pill`, `full`
- Shadows: `xs`, `tab`, `lg`, `btn`, `check`
- Fonts: `body` (Inter), `heading` (Oswald)
- Font sizes / weights / lineHeights from the theme tokens

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<chakra.button bg="primary" color="primaryFg" borderRadius="card" boxShadow="btn" />
```

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<chakra.button bg="#171717" color="#fafafa" borderRadius="20px" />
```

## Exceptions

- Map frost / splash blur may use `rgba` + `backdropFilter` (see `src/theme/mapOverlay.ts`).
- If Figma needs a new value, add a token in `system.ts` and document in `docs/ui/design-tokens.md` — do not sprinkle hex in JSX.
